msgid "osm2pgrouting Overview"
msgstr ""

#: ../../build/docs/general-intro/overview.rst:76
msgid "osm2pgrouting is a command line tool that imports OpenStreetMap data into a pgRouting database. It builds the routing network topology automatically and creates tables for feature types and road classes. osm2pgrouting was primarily written by Daniel Wendt and is now hosted on the pgRouting project site."
msgstr ""

